{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055012_6db0fcf2","chunk_index":15,"job_id":"mwjob_bb370670e7bc8936451212fd","precondition_digest":"4a6e79ad1a018b35e8d9fb9ec3e6615eae80ab09f96c3d0a0d5c5c36ea6962d6","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v9","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_592627c65fa92131","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3a882d12f1c39d5","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1bab119d767e0f49","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_e093ad5004cde0c6"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055012_6db0fcf2","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"妊娠事件的报告与随访","missing_source_classes":["项目妊娠事件报告与随访专项文件","妊娠事件报告对象、时限与妊娠结局随访的项目实施规则来源"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本项目已确认的事实仅包括妊娠或哺乳期女性被排除在入组范围之外，以及筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周的时间安排；妊娠事件报告对象、报告时限、妊娠结局随访与受试者医学处置规则缺少可用来源支持，需医学作者依据本项目妊娠事件管理文件补齐后再完成本章内容。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（妊娠事件的报告与随访）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_592627c65fa92131","section_number":"8.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2218f9bfe6836789b5c61b69","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055012_6db0fcf2","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_stat_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_primary_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。\n其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"8720e98c93e0a0d606f101ccdb8e741d9a9cc1871cb7163829f0d048a6f3705e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_secondary_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sample_size"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否\n期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"3deb9bac879bd9b7640c483aa2f9818610b5e6e19c4e8c1bbbc26a05016a1863","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_no_interim"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_stat_strategy","span_estimand","span_primary_endpoint","span_secondary_endpoints","span_sample_size","span_no_interim"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为确证性III期研究，统计分析以优效性检验为目标。主要分析针对主要终点，即第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例，采用全分析集并按随机分组进行比较，方法为CMH检验，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，检验水准为双侧α=0.05。估计目标采用治疗策略，治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；受试者停药或使用救援治疗时按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补。主要缺失数据处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析。关键次要终点为第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例，以及第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例；其他次要终点为第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。样本量基于第16周PASI 75应答率试验组60%、安慰剂组30%的假设，按双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机并考虑15%脱落进行估算，共计划入组132例，每组66例。本研究不开展期中分析，也不计划进行样本量再估计。","rationale":"主要终点及其应答定义、估计目标策略、全分析集按随机分组的CMH比较、无应答填补与敏感性分析，以及样本量假设（试验组60%、安慰剂组30%、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机、15%脱落、共132例）均来自本项目已确认研究事实。医学作者需核对全分析集的正式定义、次要终点的检验顺序与多重性控制策略，以及统计分析计划中与主要分析对应的具体分析细则。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["估计目标同时出现治疗策略人群与复合策略；请由统计负责人统一伴发事件策略后再采纳。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b3a882d12f1c39d5","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2218f9bfe6836789b5c61b69","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055012_6db0fcf2","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_stat_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_periods"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_safety_endpoints","span_stat_strategy","span_visits","span_study_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"安全性数据分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"安全性数据分析基于安全性分析集进行，安全性分析集按受试者实际接受的治疗分析。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件的发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。研究期间的安全性数据自第1天起采集，覆盖为期16周的双盲治疗期，并在第20周安全性随访访视时继续采集。上述安全性终点按治疗组进行评价，安全性分析结果用于支持对合成试验药A安全性特征的总体判断。","rationale":"安全性分析集按实际治疗分析、TEAE及严重不良事件与导致停药的不良事件发生率、实验室检查与生命体征及12导联心电图的临床意义变化均来自已确认研究事实；安全性数据采集覆盖双盲治疗期与第20周安全性随访访视。医学作者需核对不良事件按系统器官分类和首选术语的汇总方式、严重程度分级呈现、实验室检查与心电图异常的判定阈值，以及统计分析计划中对应的安全性分析细则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1bab119d767e0f49","section_number":"9.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2218f9bfe6836789b5c61b69","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922055012_6db0fcf2","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_adherence"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_visits","span_study_periods","span_adherence"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"数据采集与管理","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的数据采集与既定访视安排相对应。受试者在签署知情同意后进入筛选期，筛选期最长4周；符合入组条件的受试者于基线/第1天完成随机，随后在第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，并在第20周进行安全性随访访视。PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价。依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。各访视的评估结果、受试者日记及相关记录共同构成研究的数据来源，用于支持疗效评价与安全性评价。","rationale":"访视安排（基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视，第20周安全性随访）、PASI和sPGA评价时点（基线及第4、8、12、16周）以及依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价均来自本项目已确认研究事实。医学作者需核对CRF设计与填写要求、数据管理流程与数据库锁定安排、源数据核查与数据职责分工、数据质疑与缺失处理流程，以及各访视中实验室检查、生命体征、心电图和体格检查的具体采集内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_e093ad5004cde0c6","section_number":"10","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2218f9bfe6836789b5c61b69","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2218f9bfe6836789b5c61b69","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2218f9bfe6836789b5c61b69","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"e1861c1cf06a9cedf1ffd780e8cdb5aa72f21bb16533754d3900ee2997f2a66c"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:779|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"15c0e0648fb1262269fbc08e6dc67ec9615feeae6b6fd1d8cce97600976fd30f"},{"locator":"section:6.3.4 妊娠|block:1004|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:152c1e08c78e76","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"cb010b851f23cc35b2475172482dcafaa036b5ccf3fff41bdf7856b256c21d01"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:1005|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:30fd7cd8503aae","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9fb0a4912da17b734c482911e3f8676a02e40742fe9755f9bc660005ec3f235b"},{"locator":"section:不良事件的随访|block:831|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"e9a73951b4b81029575c055f51e285b89ca3c683bf8d59bb10d324446e599f88"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:780|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:607449f013b59d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b9b87b6fdc7e1f66998ba71f26c620e9ef58283aa6a13ea02f7d4f9d3fff3781"}]}